/-!
# The 2,116-node period-32 shielding certificate pool

The 67 displayed blocks are the period-32 temporal-pair data used by
Rule30PeriodThirtyTwoShielding.  The generic Node, closure checker and
soundness theorems are prior Rule30PrizeKit machinery from
Rule30FiniteClockCertificate; this module supplies only the period-32 data
and its shielding predicates.  Universal coverage is proved only after the
separate kernel-check modules are assembled.
-/

